    <!--
      No ProjectReference and no PackageReference, on purpose, and a rule holds it that way: this
      project is the one assembly every surface may reach — the WebAssembly client, the BFF and
      the API hosts alike — and anything it referenced would ride into all of them. The resx files
      beside each marker type embed themselves; IStringLocalizer stays in the consumers. See
      ADR 0088.
    -->

</Project>
